caption: GATES Setting Rules — Cybernetics Tradition Mastery
technology-rule: cybernetics-tradition-mastery

A character who has mastered the Tier 1 Cybernetics Tradition may treat cybernetic IQ and DX enhancement as requiring the equivalent of a Non-Volitional AI rather than a Volitional AI. For that character, the maximum bonus to IQ or DX is 2 × (Effective Implant Computer Complexity − 2), minimum +0.

With an unmodified Tiny implant computer, the ordinary/mastered caps are TL9 +0/+2, TL10 +4/+6, TL11 +8/+10, and TL12 +12/+14. With the strongest normally available options, the caps are TL9 Genius +4/+6, TL10 Genius +8/+10, TL11 Genius plus FTL +14/+16, and TL12 Genius plus FTL +18/+20.
